      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 361
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-09-08T09:36:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "A related issue remains in this callback path: tfs_check_support_cb may change sa-\u003etfs_type to NO_TFS, but the runtime and both output next indices were initialized earlier from _tfs_type. The SA then reports TFS disabled while packets still go to the TFS encapsulation node. Could we reinitialize the runtime and output next slots after the downgrade, or reject the SA instead?",
      "parentUuid": "1db29b90_2f6c6c78",
      "revId": "91527b5f1d8a06899a6c27c8b340b645ac490202",
      "serverId": "6d2eb258-4fe2-443e-8a38-ca81da23d4c2"
    },
    {
