      "message": "The callback is now reached on the traditional path too, but this delete passes the request policy rather than the matched stored policy vp. API and CLI delete requests initialize sa_index to zero, so the IPTFS callback can detach state for SA 0 rather than the SA attached to this policy. Could this pass vp instead?",
